<title>CHINA: China 1996 crude, natural gas output up.</title>
<headline>China 1996 crude, natural gas output up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 158.51 million tonnes of crude oil in 1996, a rise of 6.37 percent compared with 1995, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Crude oil production in December alone was 13.44 million tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
<p>Natural gas output totalled 19.904 billion cubic metres in 1996, up 15.74 percent compared with the previous year, it said.</p>
<p>December gas production was 1.626 billion cubic metres.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
